# attributes, then continuous queries, then events
DEFINE price int
DEFINE country string
DEFINE tags string_list
DEFINE score float
subscribe 1 price > 10 and country in ["US", "CA"]
SUBSCRIBE 2 not (price > 10) or tags one of ["a"]
SUBSCRIBE 3 score between 0.5 and 1.5 and country = 'DE'
SUBSCRIBE 3 price = 1
PARSE price > 10 and country in ["US","CA"]
EVENT price=12;country="US"
EVENT price=5;tags=["a","b"]
EVENT score=1.0;country="DE";price=99
EVENT price=5;bogus=1
SUBSCRIBE x bad
SUBSCRIBE 4 price >
UNSUBSCRIBE 2
UNSUBSCRIBE 2
COUNT
STATS
VALIDATE
DOT
BOGUS
QUIT
